{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f690f1140f82973fa9ca9286136fb71eb73b2c8957994f5541c0baf9cd34f1",
      "text": "（写给双亲的信……\n那确实是幼年时期的事了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdede9c9914ba3e314c78a37814ebaad258083b60ea11df824953e36b0f12292",
      "text": "（我记得是写给总是离开巢穴的双亲，\n“希望能多陪在我身边”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608dff0eb0d1d0fa08b688138c43459e7ef731b942be46c60b502872f84710ec",
      "text": "（连我自己都觉得，小孩子还真是坦率啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7799e217a42daa44cdeeb6d461559355e689a3aa3d2b11e75b3b980597ddb2cb",
      "text": "（……真怀念啊，这封信）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:727eb84101bd26c862b5b4cac2d4af152557a333234effe4cd53e2ea11e23ad4",
      "text": "（希望能得到认可，接受我喜欢可爱的事物，\n但又没有信心能好好传达）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c86343c3433f152ef3a654a2b58a24946a24bdccd383ab0556b8ed2337df5b2",
      "text": "（烦恼了很久，才写成了信呢。\n结果最后也没能交出去就是了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000041:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97516f1255a76816e4a74d9dfe5d58cdcb71c2af6ce6b1aed1f994e2258b26eb",
      "text": "东云，你已经来了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc0a7a4075b9c739f53ced1f97df724b2b8d988e366b5c247443537bd158b380",
      "text": "嗯。我想带着烤点心去参加\n今天的感谢祭商讨会。神谷呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b35a02424d7f36e6542d98c039ecc7bd9bb333f096e82df634e9f715795cee96",
      "text": "我也是想着顺便带上调配茶，\n才顺道来这里的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2038893eb934a6a8a575ab1ac1c1ae8ad10ad5add7b54b5b6509816f7d21369",
      "text": "能遇上你真是太好了呢。\n你还没习惯去事务所的路吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1fcbf95661a98b97c39d57d6ea3fa0628b0b9d7c4e03357a177e518b941cbf",
      "text": "前些天你也迷路了……\n点心烤好之后，我们一起过去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6cfc79f863acb506554989f64f7265474fe4dc92bddc72c0ef984951dee862",
      "text": "不好意思啊，那就拜托你了。\n我这边准备好了也会叫你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
